          "artistEn": "Jay Chou feat. Fei Yu-ching",
          "note": "A duet with Fei Yu-ching, a much-loved singer of an older generation — Jay's modern voice answers Fei's smooth classic style. 里 is a traditional unit of distance (about half a kilometre), so 千里 means “very, very far”.",
          "noteZh": "周杰伦和费玉清的合唱；「里」是古代的长度单位，「千里」就是很远很远。",
          "words": [
            {
              "zh": "千里",
              "py": "qiānlǐ",
              "en": "a thousand li — very far"
